      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bà ba kàn jiàn le xīn xiǎng lǎo po zhēn hǎo gěi wǒ zhī máo yī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s dad noticed this and thought to himself: “My wife is really great! She’s knitting a sweater for me!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "于是，他说：“我觉得蓝色的好看！”",
      "traditional": "於是，他說：“我覺得藍色的好看！”",
      "pinyin": "yú shì tā shuō wǒ jué de lán sè de hǎo kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "And so, he said: “I think blue looks nice!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小明妈妈笑了笑，没有说话！",
      "traditional": "小明媽媽笑了笑，沒有說話！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma xiào le xiào méi yǒu shuō huà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s mom laughed but didn’t say anything."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "过了几天，小明爸爸下班回来，",
