      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "看到那件蓝色的毛衣穿在了他们家的小狗身上，小明爸爸大叫：",
      "traditional": "看到那件藍色的毛衣穿在了他們家的小狗身上，小明爸爸大叫：",
      "pinyin": "kàn dào nà jiàn lán sè de máo yī chuān zài le tā men jiā de xiǎo gǒu shēn shang xiǎo míng bà ba dà jiào",
      "english": "A few days later, Little Ming’s dad came back from work."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "“啊？这毛衣不是织给我的吗？”",
      "traditional": "“啊？這毛衣不是織給我的嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "a zhè máo yī bú shì zhī gěi wǒ de ma",
      "english": "When he noticed that the family’s little dog was wearing the blue sweater, Little Ming’s father yelled out:"
