    "sentence_translations": [
      "You Wish!",
      "",
      "One day, Little Ming’s mom was knitting a sweater.",
      "",
      "Little Ming’s dad noticed this and thought to himself: “My wife is really great! She’s knitting a sweater for me!”",
      "",
      "And so, he said: “I think blue looks nice!”",
      "",
      "Little Ming’s mom laughed but didn’t say anything.",
      "",
      "A few days later, Little Ming’s dad came back from work.",
      "When he noticed that the family’s little dog was wearing the blue sweater, Little Ming’s father yelled out:",
      "“What? Weren’t you knitting that sweater for me?”",
      "",
      "Little Ming’s mom said: “You wish!”"
    ]
  }
